606	     * Move a DRAFT, OPEN or PENDING claim to another person on the sheet. It keeps its number and
607	     * date, is unbound from any statement (live again until its new person's next statement), and
608	     * is listed first under its new person. Refused (403) for a role the permission matrix does not allow, (409) for a SETTLED or VOID
609	     * claim or a move to the person it is already on, (400) for a correction (it must stay with
610	     * the claim it corrects), (423) when dated inside a closed period and (422) when dated after
611	     * the new person's retirement date.
612	     */
613	    @Transactional
